WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.802
-Chelsea, you're known for
having strong opinions

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:04.103
about all different kinds
of things.

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:05.371
So with that in mind,
I'd like to play a game with you

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:06.973
called "Wheel of Opinions."

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:08.074
Here we go.

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:12.245
♪ -Wheel of Opinions ♪

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:13.846
-Thank you for always
playing something with us.

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:15.147
Here's how it works.

00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:17.217
I'm going to hit this button,
which will activate

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:20.953
the opinion topic generator, and
it'll land on a random topic,

00:00:20.953 --> 00:00:24.290
and whatever it is, you have to
give your opinion on it, okay?

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.759
Could be right or wrong, could
be short, long, here we go.

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:28.595
Ready? And now we go.

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:38.070 line:0%
-Ooh.
-Alright, goatees. [ Laughs ]

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.974 line:0%
-Goatees can go eff themselves
is where they can go.

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:42.942 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, my goodness.

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:46.813 line:0%
-It's out of style and they're
gross, so just stop it.

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:48.280 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:50.116 line:0%
-Really?

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:52.251 line:0%
You don't know anyone
that's ever -- No.

00:00:52.251 --> 00:00:54.486 line:0%
-It's not -- No, just stop it.

00:00:54.486 --> 00:00:55.922 line:0%
Either grow a beard --

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:58.157 line:0%
Even a mustache is cooler
than a goatee.

00:00:58.157 --> 00:00:59.826 line:0%
A goatee is so uncool.

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:02.094 line:0%
All it says to me is
that you're a Republican.

00:01:02.094 --> 00:01:04.096 line:0%
[ Audience ohs, laughs ]

00:01:04.096 --> 00:01:07.000 line:0%
-[ Laughing ] Let's get another
topic. Here we go.

00:01:12.371 --> 00:01:14.040 line:0%
-Ah! [ Laughs ]

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:15.608 line:0%
-Oh, my God!

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:17.476 line:0%
I'm sure you're gonna have
an opinion on this.

00:01:17.476 --> 00:01:19.979 line:0%
Legalizing mushrooms.

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:22.515 line:0%
-Oh, yeah, my mushrooms are
just about to kick in.

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:24.784 line:0%
I take mushrooms
almost every day.

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:29.355 line:0%
I mean, microdosing mushrooms
is a game changer,

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:31.658 line:0%
and psilocybin is
good for everybody.

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:34.394 line:0%
It puts you in a good mood,
keeps you upbeat,

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:35.662 line:0%
and makes you appreciate nature.

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:38.130 line:0%
So yeah, legalizing mushrooms
for sure.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:41.534 line:0%
-Wow.
[ Applause ]

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:46.172
I know you know about that stuff
because I've seen the --

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:48.007
What was the ayahuasca one?

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:49.976
Is that mushrooms?
-Oh, yeah, ayahuasca.

00:01:49.976 --> 00:01:51.444
Yeah, I'll do any drug.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:55.181
I'll try anything. For all of
humanity, give it to me first.

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.949
[ Laughter ]
-Alright, here we go.

00:01:56.949 --> 00:01:58.718
Chelsea, are you rubbing
your hands?

00:01:58.718 --> 00:02:00.086
Or is there a dog?

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:01.588
-Oh, there is a dog.

00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:03.255
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.255 --> 00:02:06.259
Did you think I --
[ Laughs ]

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:09.562
-I don't know what was --
You're going like...

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:13.366
You were getting into like
a dance routine for a second.

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:15.434
-Hold on.
Let me try and get him up here.

00:02:15.434 --> 00:02:16.702
He's pretty big.
-Oh!

00:02:16.702 --> 00:02:18.704
-[ Grunts ]
-Oh!

00:02:18.704 --> 00:02:21.140
Pretty big?!
Oh my, Chelsea, be careful!

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:22.808
Oh, my God!
-Oh, Bert.

00:02:22.808 --> 00:02:25.945
Say hi, Bertie. Say hi!
-Oh, my goodness.

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:28.481
Are you kidding me?
Look at that cute dog.

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:30.316
Hi, buddy.
-Oh, he's falling off now.

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:31.651
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:34.454
That's my proof, you guys.
That's my proof!

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:36.589
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.589 --> 00:02:38.824
-Here we go.
Let's get another topic.

00:02:38.824 --> 00:02:40.627
That was a great exit.
Here we go.

00:02:45.364 --> 00:02:48.067 line:0%
Okay.
-Frozen --

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:50.303 line:0%
-Versus on the rocks margaritas.

00:02:50.303 --> 00:02:51.871 line:0%
-Well, you know what
I just want to say is,

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:54.073 line:0%
you brought up mushrooms,
which I did just take some

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:56.041 line:0%
right before our interview,
some chocolate mushrooms.

00:02:56.041 --> 00:02:59.545 line:0%
And I made myself a frozen mar--
well, no, a margarita

00:02:59.545 --> 00:03:02.749 line:0%
on the rocks
for our special interview,

00:03:02.749 --> 00:03:04.851 line:0%
so this is all coming together
very nicely.

00:03:04.851 --> 00:03:06.019 line:0%
-Oh, my gosh!
[ Applause ]

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:08.254
It's almost --
Oh, look, the dog's leaving.

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:09.722
Chelsea, I love you.

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:11.090
Thank you so much for coming on.

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:13.125
That is all the time we have
for "Wheel of Opinions."

00:03:13.125 --> 00:03:14.460
My thanks to Chelsea Handler.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:17.396
Her stand-up special,
"Chelsea Handler: Evolution,"

00:03:17.396 --> 00:03:19.899
is streaming on HBO Max.
Check it out.

